Amazon Shopping patches (added 2026-11-21)
==========================================

The Amazon Shopping patches in Lynx Patches (Remove ads, Price history
charts, Dark mode, Disable video autoplay, Disable search suggestions
tracking, Open links in browser, Hide Alexa for Shopping tab and Fix Amazon
manifest conflicts) and their extension code (AmazonHelper and AmazonUrls)
come from morphe-patches by rushiranpise
(https://github.com/rushiranpise/morphe-patches), licensed under GPL-3.0.
The ad-blocking selectors, the dark-mode CSS and the WebView injection
approach they use come from amznkiller by hxreborn
(https://github.com/hxreborn/amznkiller), licensed under GPL-3.0.

These files were modified for Lynx Patches on 2026-11-21: moved to the
app.amazon packages, Amazon India dropped, Amazon Shopping declared as an
APKM bundle for 32.19.0.100 and 32.20.2.100, "Hide Rufus tab" renamed to
"Hide Alexa for Shopping tab" and switched off by default, and every patch
records a flag for the Lynx Patches menu. Each file keeps the copyright line
of rushiranpise. rushiranpise and hxreborn did not make or endorse Lynx
Patches.

